{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39966","headline":"渤海宾贡高元固先辈闽中相访云本国人写得夤斩蛇剑御沟水人生几何赋家皆以金书列爲屏障因而有赠 · 徐夤","name":"渤海宾贡高元固先辈闽中相访云本国人写得夤斩蛇剑御沟水人生几何赋家皆以金书列爲屏障因而有赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"折桂何年下月中，闽山来问我雕虫。\n肯销金翠书屏上，谁把刍荛过日东。\n郯子昔时遭孔圣，繇余往代讽秦宫。\n嗟嗟大国金门士，几个人能振素风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}